summary:
  A widget on the desktop shows the window button.

history:
  The desktop form shows the face inline, always in sight, and the window
  cut six pixels off each side of it there. The button is not offered; a
  face that is in a window all the same keeps the way back.

target:
  package/contents/ui/SeatButtons.qml

find:
          visible: seatButtons.inWindow || !seatButtons.planar

replace:
          visible: true

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_seatbuttons.qml::test_on_the_desktop_the_corner_is_empty_and_takes_no_room.
